{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Your eyes have seen, etc., after Baal, etc.</b> The meaning: you saw the severity of idol worship beyond all transgressions, for even those who did not worship it but merely thought in their hearts and went after it to worship it — even though they had not yet worshipped it — HaShem destroyed them. This is along the lines of what they said (Kiddushin 39b, Ezekiel 14:5): ״לְמַעַן תְּפֹשׂ יִשְׂרָאֵל״ etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:14:57.559001564Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}